The formulation in system-config-soudcard ("Disable sw mixing") isn't=20
absolutely clear but I can't find a better one, any suggestions are=20
welcome. The default /etc/asound.conf in Fedora is:

defaults.pcm.card 0
defaults.pcm.device 0
defaults.ctl.card 0

Martin

